    "character_count": 248,
    "estimated_token_count": 62
  },
  {
    "id": "e35b1a26-2b80-43fe-9a12-0689e062771d",
    "parent_id": "6ad87424-3859-4ef9-bde2-8d7f0d709e53",
    "content": "## 2. Canary Deployment Strategy\nDeployments must execute via progressive canary rollout:\n1. **Canary Phase 1 (5% traffic):** Traffic routed to canary pods for 15 minutes. Error rates must not exceed 0.05%. 2. **Canary Phase 2 (25% traffic):** Traffic increased to 25% for 30 minutes.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "0ae5ccea-2c14-4d7b-a608-dc60aa0b4043",
      "title": "Engineering API Deployment SOP",
      "department": "engineering",
      "clearance_level": "internal",
      "document_type": "sop",
      "author": "DevOps Architecture Team",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "created_date": "2026-10-17",
      "tags": [
        "deployment",
        "kubernetes",
        "api",
        "sop",
        "engineering",
        "internal"
      ],
      "source_file": "api_deployment_sop.md",
      "allowed_roles": [
        "employee",
        "manager",
        "admin",
        "executive"
      ],
      "extra_attributes": {}
    },
    "character_count": 284,
    "estimated_token_count": 71
  },
  {
    "id": "0082bc6e-98b9-4e00-a6e0-0d4433505c4d",
    "parent_id": "6ad87424-3859-4ef9-bde2-8d7f0d709e53",
    "content": "Memory utilization must remain below 75%. 3. **Full Promotion (100% traffic):** If all health metrics remain green, the release is promoted to 100% across all production nodes. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "0ae5ccea-2c14-4d7b-a608-dc60aa0b4043",
      "title": "Engineering API Deployment SOP",
