    "parent_id": "ee687f53-ebc9-48d3-8533-d6c04848edd0",
    "content": "## 2. Annual Performance Incentive Plan (APIP)\nExecutive cash bonuses are determined according to annual corporate EBITDA milestones:\n- Threshold attainment (80% of annual recurring revenue target): 50% target payout. - Target attainment (100% ARR target): 100% target payout.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "9a8f24c0-f8aa-46ad-be98-7b7196facc70",
