    "parent_id": "ee687f53-ebc9-48d3-8533-d6c04848edd0",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
