    "parent_id": "ee687f53-ebc9-48d3-8533-d6c04848edd0",
    "content": "## 3. Equity Acceleration and Double-Trigger Provisions\nIn the event of a change-of-control transaction (Merger, Acquisition, or Sale of Assets):\n- 100% of unvested Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) accelerate immediately upon termination without cause within 12 months following transaction close (Double-Trigger Clause).",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "metadata": {
