    "parent_id": "f25eeea9-389b-40c2-9c7c-ed0cf7786ca0",
    "content": "# Corporate Travel, Meals and Expense Reimbursement Policy ## 1. Flight and Transportation Standards\nAll business travel must be booked via Navan (formerly TripActions) at least 14 days in advance to secure favorable enterprise rates.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "metadata": {
