    "parent_id": "c96d3f22-d620-4542-a8d6-490873b46537",
    "content": "- Leave requests exceeding 5 consecutive business days require manager approval at least 14 days in advance via Workday. - Sick leave: Employees receive up to 10 paid sick leave days annually with no medical certificate required for absences under 2 days. ## 2.",
